  "title": "Best Rolls Ever!",
  "description": "A yeast-roll recipe which uses self-rising flour for the most airy, delicious rolls ever! Note: the secret to these light and airy rolls is NOT punching down the dough and NOT kneading it, plus the added lift the self-rising flour gives.",
  "authors": [
    "Cara A Austin"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-12-15T08:31:03-05:00",
  "date_modified": "2022-08-04T11:38:24-04:00",
